      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Successful delivery to recovery partner (W5165/W5166)
Frequency: Per shipment delivery
Volume: ~30–40 recovery batches certified monthly
Owner: EPR Compliance Manager
Participants: Recovery Partners (Cement plant/Recycler), External Auditor, Document Control (VS-88)
Source: workflow W5167 — Waste-to-Energy (WTE) Co-processing Certification &amp; Recovery Audit Trails</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5167_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5167_Lane1" name="EPR Compliance Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5167_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
