        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-768 (ensure controlled execution — Outbound Plastic Recovery Partnerships &amp; Waste-to-Energy Co-Processing (PA-179.2).) | - CTL-768: Baling machines inspected weekly; lock-out/tag-out keys managed by shift supervisors.
Owner: DC Safety Officer / OSH Manager (VS-24)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
